<title>USA: Somers SD 29, Mont., won by Dean Witter Reynolds.</title>
<headline>Somers SD 29, Mont., won by Dean Witter Reynolds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter said it won $2.500 million ofSomers SD 29, Mont., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.1204 percent.</p>
</text>
